Third-party content
-------------------

This project includes a vendored, modified subset of Craig Gidney's
"Inplace Access to the Surface Code Y Basis" code at
src/surface_code/circuits/_y_measurement/, distributed under CC-BY 4.0 (see
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Source: https://zenodo.org/records/7487893

The noise-engine helpers in src/surface_code/noise_models/_noise_core.py
are also modified from the same author's noise-model code at
https://github.com/Strilanc/inplace-y-basis-2023/blob/main/src/midout/gen/_noise.py
distributed under CC-BY 4.0. See file headers for attribution and what was
modified.
